<section class="py-4 am-carousel">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <!-- Wider on desktop but still centered -->
            <div class="col-12 col-lg-11 col-xl-10 mx-auto p-3">
                <div id="amGallery"
                     class="carousel slide shadow-sm"
                     data-bs-ride="carousel"
                     data-bs-interval="5000"
                     data-bs-touch="true"
                     data-bs-pause="hover"
                     aria-label="Галерия">

                    <!-- Indicators (6 slides) -->
                    <div class="carousel-indicators">
                        <button type="button" data-bs-target="#amGallery" data-bs-slide-to="0" aria-label="Снимка 1" class="active" aria-current="true"></button>
                        <button type="button" data-bs-target="#amGallery" data-bs-slide-to="1" aria-label="Снимка 2"></button>
                        <button type="button" data-bs-target="#amGallery" data-bs-slide-to="2" aria-label="Снимка 3"></button>
                        <button type="button" data-bs-target="#amGallery" data-bs-slide-to="3" aria-label="Снимка 4"></button>
                        <button type="button" data-bs-target="#amGallery" data-bs-slide-to="4" aria-label="Снимка 5"></button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="carousel-inner">
                        <!-- 1) Regular guy -->
                        <div class="carousel-item active" data-bs-interval="5000">
                            <img src="~/images/carousel/1.jpg" class="d-block w-100 am-slide-img" alt="Alpha Mode — ревю 1" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                            <div class="carousel-caption">
                                <div class="bg-dark bg-opacity-75 rounded-3 p-3 d-inline-block text-start mx-auto" style="max-width:760px;">
                                    <small>
                                        „След работа бях нервен и изцеден; на тренировка нямах сила. Alpha Mode ми върна спокойствието и ми дава енергия да завършвам сериите.“
                                    </small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 2) Office guy -->
                        <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="5000">
                            <img src="~/images/carousel/2.jpg" class="d-block w-100 am-slide-img" alt="Alpha Mode — ревю 2" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                            <div class="carousel-caption">
                                <div class="bg-dark bg-opacity-75 rounded-3 p-3 d-inline-block text-start mx-auto" style="max-width:760px;">
                                    <small>
                                        „По цял ден съм пред екрани—умът ми беше замъглен, а тялото тежеше. Сега мисля по-ясно и не се сривам следобед.“
                                    </small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 3) Fitness coach -->
                        <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="5000">
                            <img src="~/images/carousel/3.jpg" class="d-block w-100 am-slide-img" alt="Alpha Mode — ревю 3 (треньор)" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                            <div class="carousel-caption">
                                <div class="bg-dark bg-opacity-75 rounded-3 p-3 d-inline-block text-start mx-auto" style="max-width:760px;">
                                    <small>
                                        „Като треньор виждам два проблема—разфокус и бавно възстановяване. При мен Alpha Mode стабилизира фокуса и скъси времето за връщане във форма.“
                                    </small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 4) Fit guy -->
                        <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="5000">
                            <img src="~/images/carousel/4.jpg" class="d-block w-100 am-slide-img" alt="Alpha Mode — ревю 4 (активен)" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                            <div class="carousel-caption">
                                <div class="bg-dark bg-opacity-75 rounded-3 p-3 d-inline-block text-start mx-auto" style="max-width:760px;">
                                    <small>
                                        „Имах нервност преди тренировка и пад в издръжливостта към края. Сега съм по-спокоен и държа темпо до последната серия.“
                                    </small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 5) Fit guy -->
                        <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="5000">
                            <img src="~/images/carousel/5.jpg" class="d-block w-100 am-slide-img" alt="Alpha Mode — ревю 5 (активен)" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                            <div class="carousel-caption">
                                <div class="bg-dark bg-opacity-75 rounded-3 p-3 d-inline-block text-start mx-auto" style="max-width:760px;">
                                    <small>
                                        „Преди се изтощавах психически, а силовите ми падаха вечер. Alpha Mode ми дава равна енергия и по-добър фокус за тежките повторения.“
                                    </small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#amGallery" data-bs-slide="prev" aria-label="Предишна">
                        <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </button>
                    <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#amGallery" data-bs-slide="next" aria-label="Следваща">
                        <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>